    [Doc][Misc] Update translation links and format admonitions in documentation (#19004)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR updates Chinese translation files (`.po`) for various model
    tutorials to point to the Chinese version of the MindIE Motor
    documentation. It also standardizes the note and warning admonitions in
    `speculative_decoding.md` to use the `!!! note` and `!!! warning`
    syntax.
    
    However, in `graph_mode.po`, the `msgid` field was manually modified to
    change an English URL to a Chinese one. This is incorrect because
    `msgid` represents the source string and should not be edited manually
    in `.po` files; instead, the source `.md` file should be updated, or
    only the `msgstr` should be modified if it was a translation update.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    No tests are required as these are documentation and translation
    changes.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c4df37dfcc7f72ca41cd43801a468526ecf99a2b
    
